                  Parameters for VMODEL
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
vmodel.var   \file for variogram output
3 15   \number of directions and lags
0 0 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
90 0 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
0 -90 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
1 0.1   \nst, nugget effect
1 0.9 0 0 0   \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
10 10 10   \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
